{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122027","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122027/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122027/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122027/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122027","id":5042439120,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc75o9O_","number":122027,"title":"Fix debugger server error disappeared in editor’s output.","user":{"login":"saierXP","id":45038185,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDM4MTg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45038185?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP","html_url":"https://github.com/saierXP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-02T12:41:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T09:58:08Z","closed_at":"2026-08-08T09:52:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122027","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122027","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122027.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122027.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #122026\r\n- Maybe also relate to #81102\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nDue to the delayed emission of the play_pressed signal, the information originally written to the output panel is cleared, and the user cannot see the information of the debugger server.\r\n\r\n`play_pressed` connected to `EditorNode::_project_run_started`.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/eda2a482e9ce82e4056cfffae0ea98c1954605a1/editor/editor_node.cpp#L5548-L5551\r\n\r\nAfter you will see:\r\n<img width=\"852\" height=\"258\" alt=\"godot windows editor x86_64_TrSDUgEQ06\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4cdb1e57-4157-4231-a3ad-a170493cded1\" />\r\n\r\nOver the past few years, I have seen many people encounter the situation where the output panel displays nothing when run a scene. \r\nA reliable way to reproduce this:\r\nLet the debugger listen for an IP address that has become invalid. \r\nFor example, start the editor after enabling PC's hotspot, and set the debugger host to the hotspot’s IP; then disable the hotspot so that the address becomes invalid.","closed_by":{"login":"saierXP","id":45038185,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDM4MTg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45038185?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP","html_url":"https://github.com/saierXP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122027/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122027/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}